WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.750
Dirk: Bruno! That's the studio's only clapperboard!

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.850
Nigel: It was.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:07.400
Announcer: Live from Clay-Per-View!

00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:12.833
Dirk: Eight stars. Three bouts. One prime-time belt.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:18.780
Dirk: He's got the cover!

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.500
Referee: One! Two! Three!

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.180
Nigel: Well. That's one way to drop the mic.

00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:39.543
Announcer: Your new prime-time champion!

00:00:39.613 --> 00:00:41.753
Announcer: Your winner... Rex Granite!

00:00:42.967 --> 00:00:44.887
Nigel: Same time next week?
